alanced: reliability (conscientious), stress resilience, technical competence (computer skills, weather assessment). Concerns: communication tone, pretentiousness. Candidate D also strong: problem solving, responsibility, concentration, handles unexpected events, but moody and loner. Candidate C quick decisions, attention, caring, but egocentric, communication difficulty, not willing to further education. Candidate A anticipates danger, complex connections, spatial vision, leadership, but unfriendly, unhealthy.\n\nWe need to argue for a candidate. Perhaps choose Candidate B as provisional recommendation, citing strengths across criteria, acknowledging concerns but maybe manageable. Provide evidence.\n\nThus public message: I recommend Candidate B, because ... mention strengths and concerns. Also note that we still need to discuss others.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate B.\n\nLet's craft."}
